{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/515744-aeon-trinity-access-levels-above-omega","id":515744,"title":"Aeon Trinity Access Levels above Omega?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-15T20:54:40-07:00","id":515744,"title":"Aeon Trinity Access Levels above Omega?","content":"Been meaning to ask about this for some time: Omega is the highest known Access Level (AL), according to the Trinity Players Guide. Specifically, the quote from page 34 is:<br /> <br /> &quot;While Omega is the highest AL any operative can obtain, there are still at least two or three more access levels above it. If you\u2019ve reached ALOmega, you might even hear about them, as they are associated with those who decide the overall policies and goals of Aeon.&quot;<br /> <br /> So my question is, what would be some good names for these 2 or 3 additional ALs? (And please don't say some nonsense like Omega-1, Omega-2 and Omega-3. That's not very imaginative.) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T00:43:46-07:00","id":515915,"title":"","content":"There's already Mercer and Styles, judging by Terra Verde both with some highly cleared adjunct staff in all likelihood, the Aeon Council and maybe even a few big names from the Trinity groups too (Neptune, Triton, Proteus). Any informed members of project Rewrite or archaeologists, anthropologists and historians in their employ might enjoy levels of clearance that require special insight. If you use the Background enhancement system from Adventure! there is even a measure for that when expanded to include Clearance.<br /> I imagine absolute access might also borrow from Influence and Status beyond the xp-buyable levels of Clearance.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T00:44:22-07:00","id":515917,"title":"","content":"SA(Superior Access) green,yellow and red.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/24.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/619-deadguy","name":"DeadGuy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/a